            "Installation Steps", "Step-by-Step Installation", "Installation Walkthrough",
            "Installation Procedure", "Installation Process", "Installation Tutorial",
            "Manual Installation", "Mod Manager Installation", "Recommended Installation",
            "Quick Installation", "Installing the Mod", "Installing Mods",
            "Installing with Vortex", "Installing with MO2", "Installing with Mod Organizer 2",
            "Vortex Installation", "MO2 Installation", "Installation"
